# Seraph wings: leaf silhouette with a steep diagonal leading edge, one
# strong radiating slit to the root, scalloped distal edge, tapered
# shadow root. Grid coords are absolute canvas coords (attach 16 13 on
# the back anchor at [16,13]). Palette-role fills.
px 1
name wings
size 32 14
anchor attach 16 13
legend
  . transparent
  l steel.light
  m steel.base
rows
  ................................
  ..ll........................ll..
  ...ll......................ll...
  ...ll.ll................ll.ll...
  ...lll.ll..............ll.lll...
  ...lll.lll............lll.lll...
  ..lllll.lll..........lll.lllll..
  ...llll.lll..........lll.llll...
  ...lllll.ll..........ll.lllll...
  ..llllll.ll..........ll.llllll..
  ..lllllllll..........lllllllll..
  ..mmmmmmmmm..........mmmmmmmmm..
  ...mmmmmmmm..........mmmmmmmm...
  ................................
